+{#
+  Merged schedule: today's board (status-aware, CFI/admin only) followed by
+  each future day that has a booking, as rows of small clickable "chips" -
+  one per flight - grouped by time slot so two+ bookings at the same time
+  share one line instead of stacking as if sequential. Replaces the old
+  pair of "Today's Schedule" + a separate flat "Upcoming" table further
+  down the page. Status is shown by the chip's whole-box color plus a
+  small corner icon (open circle = scheduled, wavy = in progress, filled
+  check = complete) instead of a text badge - see flight_chip() below.
+  Clicking a chip expands it in place for the instructor/other details
+  instead of navigating away. See upcoming_future_days in
+  _dashboard_context() for how "today" is excluded from the future-day
+  groups below (today_flights is the richer view of that same day, shown
